🚀 We're Hiring: Technical Support Engineer – Finnish & English (Fully Remote) 
 Are you fluent in Finnish and English and passionate about technology and helping people? Join our international team as a Technical Support Engineer and take the next step in your career while enjoying the flexibility of working remotely!
 📍 Location: Fully Remote
 🕒 Schedule: Full-Time, Monday to Friday
 🔹 Key Responsibilities: 
Handle inbound and outbound customer calls in Finnish and English;
Provide professional assistance via phone and email;
Troubleshoot technical issues and guide customers toward effective solutions;
Assist customers with technical inquiries and product-related questions;
Accurately document customer interactions and technical cases;
Deliver a positive customer experience through friendly and efficient support;
Follow internal procedures and quality standards.
 🔹 Requirements: 
Advanced Finnish and English language skills, both spoken and written;
Strong technical aptitude and problem-solving skills;
Excellent communication and multitasking abilities;
Fast and accurate typing skills;
Attention to detail and a customer-oriented mindset;
Previous experience in technical support, IT support, customer service, or a call center is an advantage.
 🔹 What We Offer: 
Competitive salary package;
Fully remote work opportunity;
Monday-to-Friday schedule;
Professional and supportive work environment;
Ongoing training and development opportunities;
Career growth within an international team;
The opportunity to develop your technical skills and make a real impact on customer experience.
 📩 Ready for your next career move? 
 We'd love to hear from you! Send us your CV or get in touch for more details about this opportunity.
